 387:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer.c **** *   Clears a pending interrupt in the interrupt controller.
 388:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer.c **** *
 389:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer.c **** *   Note Some interrupt sources are clear-on-read and require the block 
