 391:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer.c **** *   (GPIO, UART, and so on). Otherwise the ISR will continue to remain in 
 392:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer.c **** *   pending state even though the interrupt itself is cleared using this API.
 393:Generated_Source\PSoC5/isr_Timer.c **** *
